{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.CechGoodRefinement","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.CechGoodRefinement","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.CechColimitConverse"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.toCech_bijective_of_good","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.toCech_bijective_of_good","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGoodRefinement.lean#L120-L147","doc":"**Leray-type reduction.** On a directed system of covers, if every admissible\ncover has a good refinement relative to `𝒰₀`, then `H²(𝒰₀) → Ȟ²` is a bijection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.cechClass_eq_cechClass_iff_aux","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.cechClass_eq_cechClass_iff_aux","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGoodRefinement.lean#L101-L118","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.HasGoodRefinement","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.HasGoodRefinement","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGoodRefinement.lean#L93-L98","doc":"A **good refinement** of `𝒱` relative to `𝒰₀`: an admissible cover refining\n`𝒱` and `𝒰₀` such that pulling `H²` back from `𝒰₀` is a bijection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.H2.pull_comp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.H2.pull_comp","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGoodRefinement.lean#L84-L91","doc":"Pulling along a composite is pulling twice, on classes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.H2.pull_eq_of_refines","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.H2.pull_eq_of_refines","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGoodRefinement.lean#L76-L82","doc":"Pulling a class back along two refinements gives the same class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.agrees_step_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.agrees_step_iff","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGoodRefinement.lean#L46-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CoverCocycle.Agrees","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CoverCocycle.Agrees","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGoodRefinement.lean#L36-L41","doc":"The pair `x` **agrees with** the cocycle `z` of `𝒰₀` on some admissible cover\nrefining both. ","signatureChunk":0}]}